WEBVTT

00:00:16.550 --> 00:00:19.850
yume oikakete tatakai tsuzukero
Chase after your dreams and continue the fight

00:00:19.850 --> 00:00:23.190
ai to yuuki to yuujou
Love, courage, and friendship

00:00:23.190 --> 00:00:26.690
kono blade wa ore no bunshin
This Blade is my other self

00:00:26.690 --> 00:00:29.770
chikara no kagiri moero maware
To the limits of my power, spin and be set ablaze

00:00:29.770 --> 00:00:32.820
Burning Soul

00:00:43.780 --> 00:00:46.250
hitori bocchi ja dekinai
I can't do it all alone

00:00:46.250 --> 00:00:50.170
koto mo omae ga ireba yareru
I can do it with you alongside me

00:00:50.550 --> 00:00:53.010
kono sekai no hate made mo
Come with me

00:00:53.010 --> 00:00:56.350
ore to issho ni ikou
All the way to the end of the world

00:00:58.100 --> 00:01:03.580
shi seijuu wa ai no athlete
The four Sacred Beasts are the athletes of love

00:01:04.380 --> 00:01:07.150
kagayake me wo samase
They shine as they awake

00:01:07.150 --> 00:01:09.790
Dragoon! Dranzer! Draciel! Driger!

00:01:09.790 --> 00:01:12.490
yomigaere
Resurrect!

00:01:12.850 --> 00:01:16.110
sore kakete koi ore no energy
Take to the skies, my energy!

00:01:16.110 --> 00:01:19.450
ima tachiagare seijuu
The time has come to stand up, Sacred Beasts!

00:01:19.450 --> 00:01:22.880
subete no teki wo uchitaosu tame
To defeat all our foes

00:01:22.880 --> 00:01:26.100
minna no kibou daite kakero
Hold on tight to all our hopes

00:01:26.100 --> 00:01:29.100
Shining Soul!

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:35.060
A New Friend, His Name is Max

00:01:35.500 --> 00:01:37.590
Go Shoot!

00:01:43.110 --> 00:01:45.230
That one was close.

00:01:45.230 --> 00:01:47.660
Don't give up. Let's try it again.

00:01:47.870 --> 00:01:50.110
Alright! Let's go, Dragoon!

00:01:50.110 --> 00:01:51.910
Go Shoot!

00:01:54.480 --> 00:01:56.000
I did it!

00:01:56.000 --> 00:01:58.400
It reached the top! A new record!

00:01:58.400 --> 00:02:00.220
You did it, Takao.

00:02:00.220 --> 00:02:02.000
That's Dragoon for ya.

00:02:02.000 --> 00:02:04.720
I'd expect nothing less from
a Beyblade with Seiryu in it.

00:02:04.720 --> 00:02:06.550
Right! One more time!

00:02:06.550 --> 00:02:07.930
Let's go, Dragoon!

00:02:08.200 --> 00:02:09.520
<i>Dragoon...</i>

00:02:09.520 --> 00:02:12.880
<i>It has overwhelming speed and power.</i>

00:02:13.220 --> 00:02:16.550
<i>As if it really has Seiryu inside of it.</i>

00:02:18.220 --> 00:02:20.920
<i>A Beyblade with mysterious abilities.</i>

00:02:20.920 --> 00:02:22.870
<i>That limitless power...</i>

00:02:23.410 --> 00:02:27.180
is an ideal research material for me.

00:02:27.180 --> 00:02:31.010
I will discover it's secret mechanism.

00:02:31.990 --> 00:02:34.210
Hey! Give back my Dragoon!

00:02:34.320 --> 00:02:36.070
My research material!

00:02:37.490 --> 00:02:39.340
I'm really sorry!

00:02:39.550 --> 00:02:42.790
Choppy, I've told you to
not eat weird things, right?

00:02:43.000 --> 00:02:44.060
Sorry.

00:02:45.080 --> 00:02:47.060
But it isn't some weird thing...

00:02:47.210 --> 00:02:48.760
C'mon, let's go.

00:02:50.370 --> 00:02:53.370
My precious Dragoon was
drooled on and now it's all sticky.

00:02:53.550 --> 00:02:57.020
Please don't use my neck tie to dry it!

00:02:57.220 --> 00:02:59.570
It's fine isn't it? It's already dirty, anyway.

00:02:59.570 --> 00:03:01.280
How rude!

00:03:02.170 --> 00:03:04.570
You are so funny, I like you!

00:03:05.500 --> 00:03:07.150
What'd he just say?

00:03:07.230 --> 00:03:09.480
Don't get freaked out
over a little English.

00:03:09.970 --> 00:03:13.920
He said that you're a
funny guy and he likes you.

00:03:13.920 --> 00:03:15.060
He likes me?

00:03:18.880 --> 00:03:21.210
<i>What's this guy's deal?</i>

00:03:22.400 --> 00:03:25.980
Choppy! Someone, someone save Choppy!

00:03:25.980 --> 00:03:27.280
It's that puppy!

00:03:27.280 --> 00:03:30.130
The current up ahead is stronger, and it's dangerous!

00:03:30.700 --> 00:03:36.550
Choppy!

00:03:40.510 --> 00:03:43.610
This is bad! If he drops there I won't be able to save him!

00:03:46.070 --> 00:03:46.850
That's it!

00:03:48.160 --> 00:03:52.350
Are you planning on changing the log's direction with your Beyblade to save the puppy?

00:03:52.700 --> 00:03:53.440
Yeah!

00:03:53.660 --> 00:03:54.650
That's ridiculous!

00:03:54.660 --> 00:03:56.850
We won't know unless we try!

00:03:56.850 --> 00:03:58.180
Go, Dragoon!

00:04:06.290 --> 00:04:08.320
It's too far. My aim was off!

00:04:08.400 --> 00:04:09.510
Don't give up!

00:04:11.690 --> 00:04:14.840
No! You have to aim the log, not Dragoon!

00:04:25.800 --> 00:04:26.910
The puppy is safe!

00:04:26.910 --> 00:04:27.840
Choppy!

00:04:27.840 --> 00:04:28.830
Yay!

00:04:28.830 --> 00:04:31.850
Yes! The little one's all safe!

00:04:35.520 --> 00:04:37.270
I'm glad you're safe, Choppy!

00:04:38.510 --> 00:04:40.840
I didn't think you were a Blader, too.

00:04:41.040 --> 00:04:42.940
You're pretty good, too.

00:04:42.940 --> 00:04:45.040
No, that was just a lucky hit.

00:04:45.520 --> 00:04:48.310
However, your precious Beyblade got all wet.

00:04:48.670 --> 00:04:50.880
Oh, you can speak Japanese.

00:04:51.450 --> 00:04:55.760
Let's go to my house! I'll give your wet Beyblade some maintenance.

00:04:55.980 --> 00:04:57.110
Ah, wait!

00:04:57.110 --> 00:04:59.200
What's your name?

00:05:00.340 --> 00:05:01.980
My name is Max!

00:05:01.980 --> 00:05:03.290
It's nice to meet you.

00:05:03.290 --> 00:05:04.400
Max, eh?

00:05:09.440 --> 00:05:11.300
At the river?

00:05:11.520 --> 00:05:15.940
Oh, so you made a huge effort in order to save a small life at the river.

00:05:16.340 --> 00:05:17.400
Here ya go.

00:05:17.600 --> 00:05:18.710
Thank you!

00:05:18.710 --> 00:05:20.690
This is unexpected.

00:05:20.690 --> 00:05:24.180
Max's house is a hobby
shop, and his father...

00:05:24.180 --> 00:05:27.340
Is a Japanese person with
a thick ol' beard, right?

00:05:27.340 --> 00:05:28.580
Eh, yeah...

00:05:29.710 --> 00:05:32.260
Max's mother is American.

00:05:32.460 --> 00:05:36.640
Which means Max is mixed, Japanese and American.

00:05:36.850 --> 00:05:39.370
Is this Max's mother?

00:05:39.510 --> 00:05:40.660
Let me see!

00:05:40.660 --> 00:05:42.600
She's so pretty!

00:05:42.600 --> 00:05:44.400
I'm a bit jealous!

00:05:46.280 --> 00:05:47.890
What's wrong, Max?

00:05:48.180 --> 00:05:50.450
His mother isn't in Japan.

00:05:50.870 --> 00:05:53.360
Because of a few reasons, we live separately.

00:05:53.680 --> 00:05:55.100
So that's why...

00:05:55.310 --> 00:05:57.730
I know how you feel.

00:05:58.340 --> 00:06:02.340
You see, my mother died when I was little.

00:06:02.420 --> 00:06:07.090
My father and big brother are abroad studying archaeology or something,

00:06:07.090 --> 00:06:09.300
so I live with my grandpa.

00:06:09.300 --> 00:06:12.670
Sometimes I do get lonely, but...

00:06:13.380 --> 00:06:15.480
I have this!

00:06:17.350 --> 00:06:18.590
Takao!

00:06:18.750 --> 00:06:20.710
Cheer up, Max!

00:06:20.710 --> 00:06:21.460
Alright.

00:06:21.870 --> 00:06:23.790
Takao, come on!

00:06:25.780 --> 00:06:29.180
What's this? It's so dark I can't see a thing.

00:06:30.190 --> 00:06:31.500
Surprise!

00:06:31.500 --> 00:06:33.390
Whoa, this is...!

00:06:33.890 --> 00:06:35.230
So cool!

00:06:35.230 --> 00:06:38.160
You have loads of different types of Beystadiums!

00:06:38.570 --> 00:06:41.520
This is the Beyblade training room.

00:06:41.600 --> 00:06:43.960
I always train down here.

00:06:44.330 --> 00:06:46.170
As I thought...

00:06:46.170 --> 00:06:49.550
Cool! Hobby shops are on a totally different level.

00:06:49.550 --> 00:06:51.670
I feel kinda tempted to try!

00:06:51.880 --> 00:06:55.030
Okay, Max! Let's battle!

00:06:55.340 --> 00:07:00.200
You can't expect me to just leave after you've shown me these stadiums.

00:07:00.700 --> 00:07:02.200
I don't think that's a good idea.

00:07:02.420 --> 00:07:04.700
But why? It seems okay to me.

00:07:04.700 --> 00:07:06.170
Just listen...

00:07:06.170 --> 00:07:07.480
What's with you?

00:07:07.480 --> 00:07:11.390
Takao, you're in for a bad
time if you underestimate Max.

00:07:11.860 --> 00:07:13.320
What do you mean?

00:07:13.320 --> 00:07:18.160
The shoot he used to save the
puppy wasn't just some lucky hit.

00:07:19.440 --> 00:07:23.090
He calculated Dragoon's distance
from the log and the angle

00:07:23.090 --> 00:07:26.370
all in one moment
before shooting.

00:07:26.560 --> 00:07:30.200
His skills are genuine. No, they're first class.

00:07:30.690 --> 00:07:32.230
That's why I wanna battle.

00:07:33.090 --> 00:07:36.390
I know that shoot isn't a fluke.

00:07:37.150 --> 00:07:39.790
He's an incredible Blader.

00:07:39.790 --> 00:07:41.920
That's why I wanna battle him.

00:07:42.140 --> 00:07:43.380
Takao...

00:07:44.060 --> 00:07:47.520
Max, will you accept my challenge?

00:07:49.510 --> 00:07:50.490
Okay.

00:07:50.820 --> 00:07:53.980
Which means that I'll battle you with Protoshell.

00:07:55.330 --> 00:07:57.470
Yes! That's the spirit!

00:08:00.600 --> 00:08:04.150
It's been a while since I've been here.

00:08:06.600 --> 00:08:10.080
<i>So Max uses the EZ Grip Shooter.</i>

00:08:10.720 --> 00:08:14.920
<i>It reduces spin loss and allows for accurate shots.</i>

00:08:15.280 --> 00:08:17.530
<i>Will Takao really be alright?</i>

00:08:18.240 --> 00:08:19.080
<i>Even so...</i>

00:08:19.750 --> 00:08:22.560
an interesting battle like this can't be found on the net!

00:08:23.040 --> 00:08:24.190
Standby.

00:08:24.590 --> 00:08:27.950
Okay? Three, two, one...

00:08:27.950 --> 00:08:29.520
Go...

00:08:29.520 --> 00:08:30.510
Shoot!

00:08:30.510 --> 00:08:31.440
Go, Dragoon!

00:08:31.440 --> 00:08:32.850
Go, Protoshell!

00:08:34.860 --> 00:08:38.200
Early bird gets the worm! Dragoon, attack with all you've got!

00:08:42.470 --> 00:08:46.000
How's that, Max? You won't be able to move now, right?

00:08:46.900 --> 00:08:50.530
No, it's not that he can't
move. He won't move.

00:08:50.530 --> 00:08:51.520
What?

00:08:51.520 --> 00:08:56.990
Protoshell is a defender with a hard outer ring and a low gravity point.

00:08:56.990 --> 00:09:00.940
To put it simply, it's the type of
Beyblade with a perfect defense.

00:09:00.940 --> 00:09:05.120
Dragoon's attacks are
all being deflected.

00:09:06.290 --> 00:09:11.200
So the more Dragoon attacks, the more damage it takes.

00:09:11.840 --> 00:09:14.320
Max's skills aren't just for show.

00:09:14.410 --> 00:09:18.780
Dragoon... A unique Beyblade, and speedy and powerful to boot!

00:09:18.980 --> 00:09:21.800
But I win this time.

00:09:24.670 --> 00:09:29.180
I don't care if it's a defender.
There's nothing better than my attack!

00:09:31.370 --> 00:09:33.130
Protoshell moved!

00:09:34.610 --> 00:09:36.130
Go, Dragoon!

00:09:36.130 --> 00:09:37.620
Push him out!

00:09:40.050 --> 00:09:41.510
I've got you!

00:09:41.510 --> 00:09:42.920
No, look!

00:09:47.220 --> 00:09:48.320
No way!

00:09:48.700 --> 00:09:51.320
It took itself out because
it ran out of stamina.

00:09:51.320 --> 00:09:52.880
Dragoon, down.

00:09:52.880 --> 00:09:54.380
Winner, Protoshell!

00:09:54.380 --> 00:09:57.840
Yay, I win! I won!

00:10:01.300 --> 00:10:03.270
Dragoon lost...

00:10:03.270 --> 00:10:07.360
That was a nice fight, Takao. Dragoon can still get stronger.

00:10:07.360 --> 00:10:10.200
But there's a bit of a weak point.

00:10:10.200 --> 00:10:11.440
A weak point?

00:10:11.440 --> 00:10:14.070
Your weak point, not Dragoon's.

00:10:14.070 --> 00:10:17.320
You could say all your
attacks are predictable.

00:10:17.320 --> 00:10:19.160
What do you mean predictable?

00:10:19.160 --> 00:10:22.980
He means that you're repeating the
same easy thing over and over.

00:10:22.980 --> 00:10:25.070
Think of it as another
way to say "idiotic".

00:10:25.070 --> 00:10:28.390
Shut up! I know what straightforward means!

00:10:28.390 --> 00:10:32.150
You still don't have complete
control over Dragoon.

00:10:32.280 --> 00:10:36.740
If you become one with Dragoon and add more variation to your attacks,

00:10:36.740 --> 00:10:40.260
You'll really become my rival.

00:10:41.540 --> 00:10:43.620
A real rival...

00:10:44.430 --> 00:10:46.430
You don't mince words...

00:10:46.810 --> 00:10:48.480
I want another battle!

00:10:48.480 --> 00:10:49.470
Takao...

00:10:49.470 --> 00:10:52.720
I'm gonna get my revenge. Let's battle!

00:10:53.120 --> 00:10:57.420
Perhaps you can move
that battle to another time?

00:10:57.420 --> 00:10:59.150
Chairman Daitenji!

00:10:59.720 --> 00:11:02.400
It's been a while, Mr. Mizuhara

00:11:03.400 --> 00:11:05.200
I'll introduce you, kids.

00:11:05.380 --> 00:11:07.820
This man is the chairman of the BBA.

00:11:08.080 --> 00:11:09.790
Mr. Daitenji Kogorou.

00:11:09.850 --> 00:11:11.330
The BBA?

00:11:11.330 --> 00:11:13.900
The Beyblade Battle Association?

00:11:13.900 --> 00:11:15.600
Do you know of him, Kyoujyu?

00:11:15.600 --> 00:11:17.680
Of course I do!

00:11:17.680 --> 00:11:23.910
BBA is a association that aims to
develop Beyblades and raise Beybladers.

00:11:24.750 --> 00:11:27.010
What is someone
like him doing here?

00:11:27.310 --> 00:11:33.000
He's been helping me with this
shop's Beyblades. We're old friends.

00:11:33.420 --> 00:11:36.710
Chairman, you suddenly making
your way here means that...

00:11:37.440 --> 00:11:41.560
I want to tell you personally since we've finally made a decision.

00:11:42.240 --> 00:11:43.240
Oh, sir.

00:11:44.260 --> 00:11:44.920
What?

00:11:46.780 --> 00:11:49.400
"Beyblade Battle Tournament"?

00:11:49.640 --> 00:11:55.410
It's an official tournament that welcomes
Bladers from all over the nation to participate.

00:11:55.830 --> 00:12:01.580
The winner of this tournament will be considered the true king of Beyblade.

00:12:01.580 --> 00:12:03.610
The true king of Beyblade...

00:12:03.610 --> 00:12:06.700
Oh, wonderful! It's a big event!

00:12:06.700 --> 00:12:08.060
What's wrong?

00:12:09.020 --> 00:12:12.520
People from all over the
country means that he'll join too...

00:12:14.920 --> 00:12:16.400
Kai Hiwatari.

00:12:16.580 --> 00:12:20.000
Of course Hiwatari will participate too.

00:12:20.180 --> 00:12:27.580
I've heard he's powered his Beyblade,
Dranzer, up for this Battle Tournament.

00:12:28.060 --> 00:12:29.500
Kai powered up Dranzer...

00:12:30.110 --> 00:12:34.440
I'll be an interesting event
with so many strong Bladers.

00:12:36.400 --> 00:12:38.480
I can't wait, Takao.

00:12:38.480 --> 00:12:42.350
I'll tune up Protoshell
before the tournament.

00:12:42.350 --> 00:12:44.660
And that's when we'll battle again.

00:12:44.880 --> 00:12:47.030
Yeah, bring it on!

00:12:47.280 --> 00:12:50.720
Until then you should fix
how predictable you are.

00:12:52.510 --> 00:12:57.180
I'll didn't show you before, but
I've got a awesome special move!

00:12:57.180 --> 00:12:59.240
Special move? What?

00:12:59.680 --> 00:13:02.880
No way. Like I'd tell you.

00:13:03.040 --> 00:13:05.920
Just you wait, I'll beat you next time.

00:13:05.920 --> 00:13:08.560
And Kai, too!

00:13:09.200 --> 00:13:11.330
With Dragoon by my side.

00:13:28.710 --> 00:13:29.700
How's the time?

00:13:30.100 --> 00:13:32.790
Yes, sir. It's almost been ten minutes.

00:13:33.100 --> 00:13:35.390
Good. Do it.

00:13:35.390 --> 00:13:37.020
B-But Kai...

00:13:37.020 --> 00:13:39.960
Ten minutes is a lot,
even for Dranzer...

00:13:39.960 --> 00:13:42.960
Don't hold back. If I say
do it, then you do it.

00:13:50.200 --> 00:13:51.080
Do it!

00:14:01.340 --> 00:14:03.730
Kai, what was...

00:14:07.130 --> 00:14:09.010
Decent progress.

00:14:09.560 --> 00:14:11.870
Just you wait, Takao Kinomiya.

00:14:12.410 --> 00:14:14.760
I will end you.

00:14:21.090 --> 00:14:22.320
What?

00:14:22.590 --> 00:14:24.900
You lied about having a special move?

00:14:24.900 --> 00:14:29.330
It's because Max kept making
fun of me for being predictable,

00:14:29.330 --> 00:14:32.910
and now Kai is powering up Dranzer,

00:14:32.910 --> 00:14:35.330
So I was kinda pressured...

00:14:35.330 --> 00:14:38.370
And it all just came out?

00:14:38.560 --> 00:14:40.950
Just a little longer until
the Battle Tournament.

00:14:41.420 --> 00:14:42.830
So, Kyoujyu!

00:14:42.830 --> 00:14:44.670
Please help me out!

00:14:44.670 --> 00:14:47.440
Help me develop a special move!

00:14:52.760 --> 00:15:00.240
I was thinking of before making a special move, we need to tweak Dragoon's parts around.

00:15:00.440 --> 00:15:03.360
You mean Dragoon's
power isn't up to par?

00:15:03.760 --> 00:15:05.480
It has unbeatable power.

00:15:05.480 --> 00:15:08.240
But you can't win a
battle with power alone.

00:15:08.780 --> 00:15:12.480
It means that you need to think about how to deal with various opponents.

00:15:12.480 --> 00:15:18.430
For example, if you arrange the
attack and defense levels like this,

00:15:18.430 --> 00:15:21.200
you'll increase its total performance.

00:15:21.200 --> 00:15:23.550
So basically what'll it do?

00:15:23.890 --> 00:15:28.090
By changing the way the parts are arranged, you can increase the overall balance.

00:15:28.210 --> 00:15:30.710
But the attack will decrease a bit.

00:15:31.980 --> 00:15:36.760
That won't work! If the attack decreases then it's not Dragoon anymore!

00:15:36.760 --> 00:15:44.050
This is also in order to win. In addition to attack,
defense and stamina are needed in Beybattles.

00:15:44.220 --> 00:15:45.780
You should at least understand--

00:15:45.780 --> 00:15:50.240
I said I wanted you to help
me with a special move!

00:15:50.770 --> 00:15:53.790
I don't care about
the fancy tricks.

00:15:53.790 --> 00:15:55.480
Tricks?!

00:15:55.480 --> 00:15:58.490
Do you not trust the
results of my research?

00:15:58.490 --> 00:16:00.940
What results?

00:16:01.020 --> 00:16:05.340
Beybattles are serious matches! It's a battle between two people!

00:16:05.340 --> 00:16:07.540
It has nothing to do with
data and knowledge!

00:16:07.540 --> 00:16:10.290
What's the point if you
don't fight head on?!

00:16:11.620 --> 00:16:13.110
I didn't mean that...

00:16:14.840 --> 00:16:17.770
I understand. Please do as you like.

00:16:18.850 --> 00:16:20.880
Wait, Kyoujyu!

00:16:30.240 --> 00:16:35.750
Now I've done it. I asked Kyoujyu to
help but I ended up making him angry...

00:16:37.520 --> 00:16:40.020
Why does this always happen?!

00:16:40.020 --> 00:16:41.630
You're wide open!

00:16:42.760 --> 00:16:45.320
What're you doing Grandpa?!

00:16:45.320 --> 00:16:54.460
It's rare for me to be able to teach you a lesson while training your sword skills. I call it, 'Wanting to change yourself special'!

00:16:54.660 --> 00:17:00.840
What's with the personality switch?
And you've got a weird look in your eyes...

00:17:02.030 --> 00:17:04.080
It's your imagination.
Don't worry about it.

00:17:04.080 --> 00:17:08.140
Just a little stress from you
skipping practice all the time.

00:17:08.340 --> 00:17:09.660
That's not my--

00:17:09.660 --> 00:17:11.630
What did you say?!

00:17:19.170 --> 00:17:21.580
Now, what should I do?

00:17:21.580 --> 00:17:23.180
Hey, Kyoujyu!

00:17:23.500 --> 00:17:25.870
What are you doing there?

00:17:25.870 --> 00:17:26.860
Max!

00:17:27.840 --> 00:17:31.840
What? Then Takao was lying
about his special move?

00:17:32.060 --> 00:17:35.590
It was just something
he made up on the spot.

00:17:36.560 --> 00:17:38.990
That's so cute of him!

00:17:38.990 --> 00:17:42.480
He made up a lie like that just
because he doesn't want to lose to me.

00:17:42.880 --> 00:17:47.980
When it comes to Beyblades, he gets so fired up he can't think.

00:17:48.200 --> 00:17:51.450
But that's what I like about Takao.

00:17:51.680 --> 00:17:55.680
A constant fighting spirit
is the basics of Beybattles.

00:17:55.940 --> 00:18:00.010
When Takao learns to control his guts,

00:18:00.010 --> 00:18:02.420
He'll become a real fighter!

00:18:02.970 --> 00:18:05.200
You probably think so too, right?

00:18:06.700 --> 00:18:07.900
Well, yeah.

00:18:07.900 --> 00:18:10.960
Tell Takao I said "good luck"!

00:18:11.290 --> 00:18:15.710
I look forward to fighting him after he's improved!

00:18:16.750 --> 00:18:17.820
Bye!

00:18:18.800 --> 00:18:22.620
What's the matter? And you call
yourself the grandson of a warrior?

00:18:22.880 --> 00:18:25.530
I told you I don't care about that...

00:18:26.510 --> 00:18:27.920
Why you...!

00:18:29.650 --> 00:18:32.900
Simple moves like those
can be avoided with ease!

00:18:32.900 --> 00:18:36.430
You can't win a match by
charging in and relying on power!

00:18:36.950 --> 00:18:40.390
What's with that?
It's the same with Beyblading.

00:18:40.390 --> 00:18:41.540
Well?!

00:18:41.540 --> 00:18:43.630
Now it's my turn!

00:18:46.950 --> 00:18:51.280
What? It looks like there's
multiple Grandpas coming at once.

00:18:56.210 --> 00:18:58.270
Look at that fast footwork.

00:18:58.270 --> 00:19:01.830
He's putting the pressure on his pivot leg so he can deal out quick attacks.

00:19:02.840 --> 00:19:05.000
It's just like Dragoon's grip tip.

00:19:05.280 --> 00:19:08.940
Because it has a lot of grip,
it can move at high speed.

00:19:08.940 --> 00:19:11.180
I see it! Right there!

00:19:12.780 --> 00:19:14.720
Novice.

00:19:15.770 --> 00:19:18.520
I got an idea for
my special move.

00:19:18.520 --> 00:19:20.220
Thanks, Grandpa.

00:19:28.350 --> 00:19:30.450
A real fighter, huh?

00:19:31.600 --> 00:19:33.640
I wonder if Takao is still here?

00:19:35.310 --> 00:19:39.810
Kai's Dranzer is moving up to the
next level with its ultimate balance.

00:19:40.460 --> 00:19:45.310
When he completes Protoshell, I bet Max'll have an unbeatable defense.

00:19:46.050 --> 00:19:48.620
But I can't lose.

00:19:53.750 --> 00:19:55.130
What is he...?

00:20:00.070 --> 00:20:02.560
Go, Dragoon!

00:20:02.560 --> 00:20:05.050
He shot while rotating his hand!

00:20:11.320 --> 00:20:13.200
Multiple Dragoons!

00:20:16.530 --> 00:20:17.490
It's gone?

00:20:21.540 --> 00:20:24.560
What? What was that?

00:20:29.260 --> 00:20:30.640
What's this hole?

00:20:31.690 --> 00:20:32.700
Kyoujyu?

00:20:33.170 --> 00:20:34.180
Takao!

00:20:36.420 --> 00:20:39.850
Whoa! I did it! I really did it!

00:20:40.410 --> 00:20:41.470
Max did?

00:20:41.910 --> 00:20:45.840
He said he's looking forward to fighting you at the tournament.

00:20:46.480 --> 00:20:50.760
And then he took off, quiet as the winds of the American west coast.

00:20:51.000 --> 00:20:52.540
What's that supposed to mean?

00:20:54.380 --> 00:20:55.220
Kyoujyu.

00:20:55.790 --> 00:20:59.460
Sorry for earlier.
I went out of line.

00:20:59.880 --> 00:21:01.200
It's okay.

00:21:01.520 --> 00:21:04.910
More importantly, you completed your special move.

00:21:06.270 --> 00:21:07.360
You bet.

00:21:07.820 --> 00:21:10.100
That's my special shoot.

00:21:12.290 --> 00:21:15.200
But how did you discover that shoot?

00:21:15.200 --> 00:21:16.940
It's all thanks to Grandpa.

00:21:16.940 --> 00:21:20.670
Grandpa's training gave me the idea!

00:21:20.830 --> 00:21:23.280
Just you wait, Max! Kai!

00:21:23.280 --> 00:21:25.510
I'm gonna challenge you
both at the tournament!

00:21:39.990 --> 00:21:44.780
haru wa te wo furi hohoende
Spring smiles when meeting again

00:21:44.780 --> 00:21:50.240
natsu wa jounetsu wo furimaite
Summer is sprinkled with passion

00:21:50.240 --> 00:21:55.420
kisetsu wa utsurikawatte
The seasons change

00:21:55.420 --> 00:21:59.610
aki wa fuyu ga tomodachi
and Autumn is friends with Winter

00:22:01.040 --> 00:22:05.720
kaiketsu dekinai koto tte
There are some things you can't solve

00:22:05.720 --> 00:22:11.580
shinrai yuujou aijou kanjou
Like trust, friendship, love, and feelings

00:22:14.150 --> 00:22:18.850
donna toki demo kumo wa nagareteru
No matter when, the clouds will continue to flow

00:22:18.850 --> 00:22:24.230
itsudatte onaji sora wa nai
No two skies are alike

00:22:24.230 --> 00:22:29.140
ruisen takamatte ochiru shizuku datte
Just because drops of water are welling up in my eyes

00:22:29.140 --> 00:22:33.140
kanashii wake dake janai
doesn't mean I'm sad

00:22:34.870 --> 00:22:39.470
yuuki wo dashite kotoba ni shitemiru
I'll drum up my courage and try to put it in words

00:22:39.470 --> 00:22:44.840
saa tabidatou kibou no machi e
"C'mon, let's take a journey to the city of hopes"

00:22:44.840 --> 00:22:49.800
yakusoku datte kanarazu kanau sa
I always keep my promises

00:22:49.800 --> 00:22:54.480
(It's) gonna be a clear day

00:22:57.360 --> 00:23:02.680
According to my knowledge, it's finally time to start the Beyblade Battle Tournament.

00:23:02.790 --> 00:23:06.210
And all the attention's on
Kai, the user of Dranzer.

00:23:06.210 --> 00:23:09.280
Wait, aren't they the Four
Horsemen of the Shell Killers?

00:23:09.280 --> 00:23:12.180
They're in the same group as Takao.

00:23:12.180 --> 00:23:14.320
And they seem to be planning something.

00:23:14.320 --> 00:23:17.330
And who is that mysterious Chinese boy...?

00:23:17.890 --> 00:23:19.980
Next Time! "The Curtain Opens! Battle Tournament"

00:23:19.980 --> 00:23:21.180
The Curtain Opens! Battle Tournament

00:23:21.180 --> 00:23:23.460
Ah, I'm so worried

00:23:23.460 --> 00:23:25.000
The Curtain Opens! Battle Tournament
